msgctxt "GoldSaucerTalk:462:0:17"
msgid "The current tournament will run until <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> - <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (<switch $weekday><case>Sunday<case>Monday<case>Tuesday<case>Wednesday<case>Thursday<case>Friday<case>Saturday</switch>). Tournament matches can only be played until fifteen minutes before the end of the tournament period."
msgstr "Текущий турнир продлится до <set-time $n3><if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if> — <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 <if ($hour >= 12)>вечера<else>утра</if> (<switch $weekday><case>воскресенье<case>понедельник<case>вторник<case>среда<case>четверг<case>пятница<case>суббота</switch>). Сыграть в турнирные матчи можно не позднее чем за пятнадцать минут до его окончания."

#. ja: 現在、大会は開催されていません。<br>次回の開催期間は、「大会情報」をご確認ください。
#. de: Zurzeit findet kein Turnier statt. Frag doch mal bei der Information nach dem nächsten Turnier.
#. fr: Il n'y a aucun tournoi en cours ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment.<br>Pour savoir quand a lieu le prochain, veuillez consulter la rubrique Informations.
#. column 18: OK
